{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "tasks/a-shared-room-s-failed-streams-are-each-their-agent-s",
  "title": "In a delegated room a transport is shared into, where several agents stream, another agent's streams that fail, the turns it takes on the room's answers among them, are each its own turn's failure, reported in the child room: the task completes with its agent's last answer",
  "rules": [
    "§23.3 step 5",
    "§23.3 step 6",
    "§12.2 step 13s",
    "§9.3",
    "§10.1 step 14"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: core/mixins/_child_execution.py _deliver_answer, _responder_failures, _stream_failed_by: worker and helper both answer the task by a stream, and the room's reader reads every stream the cascade starts (lane_execution.py _finish_cascade); tests/tasks/test_worker_cut_short.py::test_a_streaming_helper_s_failure_is_never_a_buffered_worker_s, test_another_agent_s_failed_turn_leaves_the_task_its_agent_s[transport-inline]. helper writes its text, then fails, on each of its turns: on the task, on worker's answer, and on worker's answer to its own text. Each failure's ON_ERROR payload carries its stream's correlation_id, one that wrote nothing too (_fire_stream_error_hook). worker's and helper's turns on the task are read one after the other, the first ready first, wherever it runs (§10.1 step 14): the two rows answering the task come in either order, so the scenario names neither row's index, nor what refers to it (what Thanks. and helper's second failure answer); Thanks. is the room's fourth row either way.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "email",
        "type": "email",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "worker",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "deltas": [
                "Found ",
                "it."
              ]
            },
            {
              "deltas": [
                "Thanks."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "helper",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "deltas": [
                "Helping."
              ],
              "fails": "The helper broke."
            },
            {
              "fails": "The helper broke again."
            },
            {
              "fails": "The helper broke a third time."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "parent",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "email"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "helper",
            "category": "intelligence"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "hooks": [
      {
        "name": "errors",
        "trigger": "on_error",
        "execution": "async"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "parent",
      "agent_id": "worker",
      "task": "Find it.",
      "share_channels": [
        "helper",
        "email"
      ],
      "wait": true,
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "status": "completed",
          "result": {
            "status": "completed",
            "output": "Thanks.",
            "error": null
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "$r1": {
        "$unordered": [
          {
            "index": 0,
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "system"
            },
            "chain_depth": 0,
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "Find it."
            }
          },
          {
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "worker"
            },
            "chain_depth": 1,
            "responds_to": "$r1#0",
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "Found it."
            }
          },
          {
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "helper"
            },
            "chain_depth": 1,
            "responds_to": "$r1#0",
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "Helping."
            }
          },
          {
            "index": 3,
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "worker"
            },
            "chain_depth": 2,
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "Thanks."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "deliveries": {
      "$r1": {
        "email": {
          "$unordered": [
            {
              "source": {
                "channel_id": "worker"
              },
              "content": {
                "type": "text",
                "body": "Found it."
              }
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "channel_id": "helper"
              },
              "content": {
                "type": "text",
                "body": "Helping."
              }
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "channel_id": "worker"
              },
              "content": {
                "type": "text",
                "body": "Thanks."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "hooks": {
      "errors": [
        {
          "trigger": "on_error",
          "room_id": "$r1",
          "event": {
            "chain_depth": 1,
            "responds_to": "$r1#0",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "helper"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "The helper broke."
            },
            "metadata": {
              "error_category": "streaming"
            },
            "correlation_id": {
              "$present": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "trigger": "on_error",
          "room_id": "$r1",
          "event": {
            "chain_depth": 2,
            "responds_to": "$any",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "helper"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "The helper broke again."
            },
            "metadata": {
              "error_category": "streaming"
            },
            "correlation_id": {
              "$present": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "trigger": "on_error",
          "room_id": "$r1",
          "event": {
            "chain_depth": 3,
            "responds_to": "$r1#3",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "helper"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "The helper broke a third time."
            },
            "metadata": {
              "error_category": "streaming"
            },
            "correlation_id": {
              "$present": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
